# Instructions for placing the macOS executable:
#
# Please compile or place the macOS standalone binary named 'mded' in this directory:
#   mded_setup_and_uninstall_mac/mded
#
# Once 'mded' is placed here, run:
#   chmod +x mded
#   ./setup.sh
#
# The setup script will automatically install it to ~/.local/bin/mded and create
# the macOS Application bundle ~/Applications/MD Editor.app.
